# VS Code REST Client / compatible HTTP client.
# Default target: explicitly selected, local demo mock; no credentials needed.
# For live API use port 8000 and set accessToken locally. Never commit a real token.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8001
@accessToken = LOCAL_MOCK_UNUSED

### Answer and source
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{"question":"Как оформить отпуск?"}

### Read the article
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/sources/20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Unknown question: mock refusal (live behavior requires evaluation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{"question":"Какая погода завтра?"}

### Validation error, HTTP 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{"question":"   "}

### Mock-only list of supported example questions
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/questions
